    \item I asked them to be quiet.
    \item He suggested that we take a taxi.
    \item She ordered them to leave.
    \item They asked us to come to the party.
    \item She told him to wait.
    \item He requested that we arrive at five.
    \item She asked them to come on Sunday.
\end{enumerate}

\subsection*{Answers}
\begin{enumerate}
\item Elle leur a dit de travailler plus dur.
\item Ils (Elles) nous ont invité(s) à dîner.
\item Il m'a demandé de l'aider.
\item Je leur ai demandé d'être silencieux.
\item Il a suggéré que nous prenions un taxi.
\item Elle leur a ordonné de partir.
